<title>POLAND: STOMIL OLSZTYN 96 NET RISES TO PLN 56.9 MLN.</title>
<headline>STOMIL OLSZTYN 96 NET RISES TO PLN 56.9 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-01-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results December</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>DECEMBER</p>
<p> Net profit	     2.54 vs  18.51 loss</p>
<p> Pre-tax loss	   0.79 vs   8.87</p>
<p> Operating loss	 1.39 vs  10.87</p>
<p> Sales		   52.36 vs  43.41</p>
<p>JANUARY-DECEMBER</p>
<p> Net profit	    56.87 vs  55.29</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	79.30 vs  80.44</p>
<p> Operating profit    72.28 vs  75.48</p>
<p> Sales		  695.98 vs 540.42</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish tyremaker is Stomil Olsztyn SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
